{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39201","headline":"闻再幸梁洋 · 韦庄","name":"闻再幸梁洋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才喜中原息战鼙，又闻天子幸巴西。\n延烧魏阙非关燕，大狩陈仓不爲鸡。\n兴庆玉龙寒自跃，昭陵石马夜空嘶。\n遥思万里行宫梦，太白山前月欲低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}